[ENGLISH]
This repository contains a fan-made, community-driven Spanish localization for
the video game "Esoteric Ebb".

"Esoteric Ebb" and all associated names, characters, assets, and intellectual
property rights are the sole property of Christoffer Bodegård.

This fan translation is non-commercial and has been created in accordance with
the developer's public statement encouraging community localizations:
https://store.steampowered.com/news/app/2057760/view/667250959956574521

No challenge to the ownership of the original intellectual property is intended.
The CC BY-SA 4.0 license applies solely to the Spanish translation text and
adaptations created by the contributors of this project.

